#### [NEW] [test_pipeline.py](file:///c:/Users/Sonu/OneDrive/Desktop/New%20folder/backend/test_pipeline.py)

Comprehensive test suite that validates the end-to-end pipeline:

1. **Test WebSocket connection + handshake** — connects, sends HANDSHAKE JSON, verifies server accepts
2. **Test speech audio produces transcripts** — sends synthetic speech audio (reuses `generate_synthetic_speech` from test_vad.py), verifies partial/final transcript events are received back via WebSocket
3. **Test silence produces no transcripts** — sends silence, verifies no transcript events
4. **Test multiple consecutive chunks** — sends multiple speech segments separated by silence, verifies pipeline processes all without restart
5. **Test backpressure (slow ASR)** — floods audio faster than ASR can process, verifies no crash, verifies pipeline recovers
6. **Test Chrome disconnect/reconnect** — connects, sends audio, disconnects, reconnects, verifies pipeline handles gracefully
7. **Latency measurement** — measures and logs end-to-end latency for each transcript event

