2. Open Chrome extension, enable WebSocket, click Start Capture on a YouTube video
3. Observe real-time partial/final transcript events in the server console
4. Verify pipeline continues processing multiple speech segments
5. Verify pipeline handles silence periods correctly
6. Check logged latency metrics

